WEBVTT

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:06.930
All systems activated.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.690
Release from stasis.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.520
All systems synchronize
to bridge standard time.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.250
What planet is this?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:32.840
Colonized planet number 0315... Earth

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.510
Then this is where
my brother Yosho is.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.430
No. All we detect so far is Ryoko.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.220
Not that woman!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:45.640
What does this mean?

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:49.390
We have yet to detect Yosho's ship,...

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.230
but he was in pursuit of Ryoko.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.940
Logically, it would follow--

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.440
Fine. That woman and Ryo-Ohki...

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.320
must be caught and tried formally

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.610
by our planet Jurai,
as soon as possible!

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.570
Princess Ayeka, unfortunately,...

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.240
all of Ryoko's crimes will be canceled

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.710
by the statute of limitations
At Galaxy Standard Time, 00432

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.670
or in five seconds.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:13.920
What?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.170
As of this moment,...

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.260
the statute of limitations
has taken effect,

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:26.260
and Ryoko's "Galaxy Wanted" file
has been deleted.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.140
Deleted?

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.440
Answer me!
Why is it?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.190
The statute of limitations...

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.110
is based on decisions...

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.150
made by the Holy Council
of planet Jurai.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.940
That is not what l have asked.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.320
l want to know why...

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.240
that woman is not sought
for all eternity.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.780
The statute of limitations...

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.490
is based on decisions...

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.450
Never mind.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.460
The only clue left is that woman.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.960
We must capture her
at any cost.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:54.920
But the statute--

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.420
This is an order!
We can think of a reason later.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:58.750
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.710
That's more like it,...

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.630
now prepare for descent.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.550
Anti-air guard,

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.600
storming level 4.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.350
Be well, my dearest Yosho...

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.770
My brother.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:21.530
Episode#2
HERE COMES AYEKA!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.490
Why are you..?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.750
Now... l want
your balls please.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.130
You mean these?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.250
You numskull!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.960
The three jewels on your sword!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.220
Otherwise, l can't
control Ryo-Ohki!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.180
Ryo-Ohki?

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.430
Don't tell me you don't
know what that is.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.390
lt's the other demon
in the legend, you dimwit.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.890
That would mean, if
l give the gems to you,

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.020
you would use them to
awaken the other demon.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.810
No ifs about it,
give them to me.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.190
No way!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.530
You made this mess yourself.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.610
You think l want to deal
with another monster...

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.240
when you're already
blowing things up?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.910
That's the last thing
l want to see.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.870
Are you sure about that?

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.410
The one approaching us
right now is even worse.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.830
Huh? What do you mean?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.330
Never mind, just give me
the sword.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.130
You--!!!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.560
Damn it!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:41.230
Ha, so you can't touch
this thing, can you?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.030
Hey, be quiet!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.410
What's going on
up there, Tenchi?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.750
What's this?!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.120
And l worried about him...

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.210
being too shy with women.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.710
Now he's sneaked one
into his room.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.550
lf l were his mother, l'd find
some excuse to barge in...

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.630
but as his father,
l'll respect his privacy.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.100
l'm begging you...

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.220
Please give them back.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.510
Well, now,...

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.430
l really can't do that.

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.770
Oh, please.
l'm begging you.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.190
O.K., l understand,...

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:22.770
but could you tell me...
what's approaching us?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:24.730
A devil.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:25.570
Huh?

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.610
She's like a devil.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.530
She's so dangerous
and mean.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.620
She'll fire at you
without giving you

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.780
a teeny-weeny little
chance to explain.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.710
Begin the capture process
as soon as we arrive,...

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.340
and you must
refrain from firing.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.170
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:47.720
We will soon arrive
at our destination.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:52.550
Well, can't we just
talk to this person,...

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:55.310
and try to settle matters peacefully?

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.980
ls she really that bad?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.150
Yes. Listen to me.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.940
We need to wake up
Ryo-Ohki, now.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.610
You mean
we're going to fight?

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.280
No, we'll run.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.990
lt's my duty
to respect his privacy,

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.200
But it's also my duty to record
my son's development in sex--

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.750
l mean life.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.410
Oh, my wife in heaven.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:24.250
Are you seeing this?
You're son is becoming a man.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.670
Wha?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.510
What the hell?!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.810
Ryoko, come out!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.020
What the?!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.480
Shit, l knew it.
She's here already.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.350
Ryoko!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.020
Ryoko, you must come out!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.020
l know that you are in there!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.110
You cannot get
away from me now!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.030
Are you sure this is on?

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:52.740
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.450
Well, then,
what is she doing?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.490
Oh, never mind.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.620
l want you to fire
a shot nearby.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:02.370
l thought we were
to refrain from firing.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.670
That's an order.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.380
You see?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.850
Yes, what should we do?

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.810
Well, for starters,
why don't you stand up?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.940
Now point the sword hilt
toward me...

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.440
and pray to have
the jewels returned to me.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.070
That's it?
That's all l do?

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.330
What--what's going on?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.540
You only gave me one!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.380
That's right.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.170
Well, it'll do.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.180
Come, Ryo-Ohki.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:09.110
Awaken.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.170
Come!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.430
lt's Ryo-Ohki.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:43.270
There you are, you
heinous criminal battleship.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.640
Attack that ship!
Fire now!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.860
What is this?
What's going on?

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.320
Why is this happening?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.780
Let's go, Tenchi.

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.200
Why me?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.410
Oh!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.370
O.K., Ryo-Ohki!
Let's make our getaway!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.470
Yes!
This is the feeling!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.890
lt's good to be able to
move freely again.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.640
Oh, man.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:22.850
My house!

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.680
Sorry, l didn't have time
to worry about it,...

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.810
so l shrank it and brought it.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.980
Dad!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.110
Dammit! You annoying little...

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.070
Launch counterattack!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.080
She cannot escape us.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.750
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.210
Go! Capture her!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.170
-Yes.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.010
Stay back!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.430
Jurai guardians...

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.570
Help me!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.330
lt's been a while,
hasn't it, Ryoko?

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:34.290
l've been looking for
you for some time.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.720
May l ask you one question?

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:46.260
Why did that Earthling
have this sword with him?

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.770
Answer me!

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.320
Stop! Stop!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.320
l'm coming! l'm coming!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.450
Enough!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.870
This seems to have
an opposite effect on you.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.290
You're behaving like--
what's that called?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.910
A masochist?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.290
Oh, yes.
That's what they call it.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.670
Actually, Little Princess,

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.250
l'm more of a sadist.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.170
Oh, l'm sorry l......

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.960
Oh never mind! That's
completely irrelavent.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.180
l'll ask you again.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.680
Why did that young man
have this sword?

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.970
You bonehead.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:28.890
What?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.180
Don't you feel it
in his blood?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.980
You're not answering
my question.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.690
Because the sword is his!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.650
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.820
You know this sword
belongs to my brother!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:42.650
Now, where is he?
Where is my brother Yosho?

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.030
Half-brother, you mean.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.740
You came all this way
just to look for him?

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.950
Things must be dull
on planet Jurai.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.950
You royal types
must be really bored.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.830
Silence, criminal!
How dare you!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.290
Well, well.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.550
My brother's disappearance
all started because of you.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.880
So that's how it happened?

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.470
O.K. Stop! Stop!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.600
Please, you can stop now!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.270
Now answer me.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:19.520
Tenchi probably knows
more about Yosho, than l do.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.480
Why would this sword...

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.900
know the whereabouts
of my brother?

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:25.360
Oh, yeah, l forgot.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.450
The sword is called Tenchi, too.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.160
No, l mean the Earthling boy.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.660
He's called Tenchi also.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.120
Oh, my.
What a coincidence.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.870
Yeah, right.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.000
Princess Ayeka,
it's time for bed.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.050
Later. l am busy.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.250
Now go away.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.960
l cannot allow that.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.470
The Queen has given me
strict orders.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.590
Oh, very well.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.430
And take her off to jail!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.140
Good night, Little Princess.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.600
Come, Princess.
This way.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.700
What is this place?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.040
Hey!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.750
Ryoko!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.460
Where did she go?

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.390
Let me out!
Let me out!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.390
l didn't have anything
to do with her!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.520
That does it!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.600
Now l'm going to let
you have it!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.690
Damn!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.440
What are you doing?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.490
Well, l'm trying to escape
from this stupid little--

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:51.700
Huh?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.000
Who are you?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.710
My name is Sasami.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.250
Sasami?

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.000
Have you been
kidnapped, also?

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.090
No, you silly.
This is our ship.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.800
This is your ship?

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:11.140
Then you're an alien
from planet Sasami?

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.550
No. You are silly.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.430
l come from the planet Jurai.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.140
What about
those weird logs?

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.680
They're not really logs.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.310
They're guardians,
our servants.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.350
Oh, man.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:23.230
What a relief.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.440
What's your name?

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.270
Oh, right.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:27.280
My name's Tenchi.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.490
Will you play with me?

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.080
You look just like we do.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.590
That's a cute pet.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.720
Hey, that looks like--

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.840
Huh?
Oh, it's gone!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.140
What's wrong?

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.470
l had a sword, but it's gone!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.850
lt must have...

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.690
Hey, Sasami,
could you do me a favor?

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.100
Could you return me home?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.900
l don't have anything
to do with anything.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.320
Well...
will you do me a favor too?

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.350
My darling Ayeka,...

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.310
l must leave here
tomorrow morning

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:44.730
to do battle with
a rampaging criminal,

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.480
but not to worry.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.190
l will defeat this
criminal and return...

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.360
And when l come back...

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.860
When you came back,

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.660
l was to become your bride,
but you never returned.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.790
Yosho...

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.970
My sister's room
is right over there.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.010
She's asleep now,
so you know what to do.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.430
Yeah, l think so.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.100
Go in there and get
her head ornament?

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.270
That's right.

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.480
But why should l?

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.150
lt belongs to her, doesn't it?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.440
Just get it!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.570
O.K., O.K.
l'll get it.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:34.240
Just make sure you
remember your promise.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.620
Sorry to barge in like this.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.760
Excuse me.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:55.920
Ohh...

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.090
Oh, man.
Give me a break.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.510
How am l supposed to get
that off of her?

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.270
The sword!
She's got it!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.850
l'll get the sword first.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.580
Yosho.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.130
Huh?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:40.590
What?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.020
lt's not what you think.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.400
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.360
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.940
l want you to put
that scoundrel to death.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.240
Oh, my.
How quickly he runs.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:01.620
Here we come.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.280
Here we come.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.830
lt's dangerous!
Let's get out of here!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.040
Can't you do something
about those things?!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.290
They're my sister's.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.500
There's nothing l can do.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.460
That way. Hurry!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.130
Hurry!
Go in there!

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.180
Well, look who's here.

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:30.390
Oh, man.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.650
Now where are we?

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.150
Yoo-hoo!

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.110
lt's her!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.280
Great timing!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.660
You got me into this!
You get me out!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:46.660
Without the other jewels,
l just can't.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.370
Stop yelling and
get me out of here.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:51.580
First, l can't open
this thing.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.540
And another--

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.210
What are you doing?

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.760
Excuse me.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.630
What's this?

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.260
Nice to meet you.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.470
l'm Sasami.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.300
Uh... yeah.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.020
Tenchi, who is this
old lady?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.850
ls she a friend
of yours also?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.270
Old lady?

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:15.690
Yes, l am,

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:19.360
But l'm not an old lady.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.150
No, indeed.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:22.950
Ow, that kinda hurts.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.030
l wonder why this opened.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.910
Hey! That sword is Yosho's.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:30.160
What? Yosho?

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.200
Uh-huh.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.370
But why were you
able to use it?

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.670
Oh, yes.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.790
Show me that sword of yours.

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:37.960
Uh-oh.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.420
Now, just a minute.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:40.960
Nothing to worry about.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:43.130
You can't touch this.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.930
Just trust me. Relax.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.470
Come on! Stop it!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.640
Be quiet.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.310
That's far enough!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.570
And here comes
the Princess.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:05.070
Sasami, l see it was you
who released him.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.910
You really shouldn't
have done that.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.200
Well, sorry.
l was just bored.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.370
That's no excuse.

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.460
You, l believe
your name is Tenchi.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:17.080
l have a question
l'd like to ask you.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:19.040
What can l do for you?

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.760
Where is the owner
of that sword you hold?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:25.470
Well, he died
a long time ago.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:26.930
You are lying!

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:30.640
That's what it says
in the ancient legend.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.100
What was his name?

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:33.480
Well, l'm pretty sure...

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.560
His name was Yosho....

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.150
Oh, no.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.900
Does that help at all?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:43.280
Oh, yeah.
He died, didn't he?

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:44.610
That's too bad.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.570
lt isn't true!
You're trying to trick me!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.240
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.030
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.530
Ayeka!

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.000
Order your blockheads
to pull back.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.410
You play dirty to the end.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:01.590
Bye-bye, lady.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.460
Sasami, come here!

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:08.840
Get back, Azaka!
No!

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:10.220
Get back!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:11.560
Stop!

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.440
What are you doing,
Tenchi?

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:18.730
What's happening?

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:20.650
l gave you an order
to capture them.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.610
The sword.... the master key
shouldn't react to anyone...

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:26.820
but those
of royal blood.

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:28.280
So why is it...

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:31.030
lt can't be.

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:34.660
No, it can't be true.

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:36.960
Tenchi...

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:38.750
Call Ryo-Ohki.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.330
You want to go home,
don't you?

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.090
lf you return my house, too.

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:43.670
l can't believe it.

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:46.050
l won't believe it.
lt is impossible.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:47.550
Suit yourself,...

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:50.220
but you should know that where
you're standing, isn't quite safe.

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:57.770
Told you so.

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.140
Let's go, Tenchi.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.100
Thank you, little girl.

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:03.980
Bye-bye, Tenchi.

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:06.900
Do something, quickly.

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:08.360
l'm sorry.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:10.570
l will never forgive
that woman.

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.370
l'll make her follow us
down to Earth.

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:17.790
As long as she's up here,
she'll only give us trouble.

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:20.120
Don't do that.
You'll hurt her.

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:23.000
Whose side are you on, anyway?

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:25.090
lf you like her, go join her.

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:26.130
She's just a girl.

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:28.970
What's your point?

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:41.230
Ryo-Ohki's mass...

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:42.810
is growing abnormally.

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:45.150
Why aren't they
under our control?

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:47.530
They have used
the master key.

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:54.160
Attack! Attack!
What are you doing?

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.830
lt's too dangerous!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:57.870
Descent velocity increasing.

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.830
lf we were to fall to Earth,...

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:02.460
even Ryu-Oh will not
escape serious damage.

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.960
How unreasonable
that woman is.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:09.800
Ryoko, stop this immediately!

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:16.760
Even you won't be able
to escape unharmed.

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:18.470
Say something!

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:21.850
Stop this immediately!

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:23.310
l know you can hear me!

00:24:23.440 --> 00:24:25.770
20 seconds
to Earth's surface!

00:24:34.950 --> 00:24:36.990
Ryoko, stop! Please!

00:24:41.500 --> 00:24:43.620
Jettison the ship's exterior!

00:25:01.980 --> 00:25:03.640
Our top story this morning--

00:25:03.640 --> 00:25:07.400
around 4 a.m., an object
believed to be a meteor...

00:25:07.400 --> 00:25:10.020
fell on the great Seto bridge.

00:25:10.020 --> 00:25:12.780
Destroying the bridge on impact.

00:25:12.780 --> 00:25:16.410
As a result, Japan Rail
has been unable to operate,

00:25:16.410 --> 00:25:19.370
with no word as to when
service will be restored.

00:25:19.580 --> 00:25:21.910
Other damage is currently
under investigation...

00:25:21.910 --> 00:25:24.790
by the Marine Safety Agency and Police.

00:25:24.790 --> 00:25:27.080
Wow. Take a look at that.

00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:28.330
lt's a major story.

00:25:29.500 --> 00:25:30.630
Hey, what's wrong?

00:25:30.630 --> 00:25:32.670
You don't look well
at all, Tenchi.

00:25:33.130 --> 00:25:35.840
Cheer up! We got back
safely, didn't we?

00:25:35.840 --> 00:25:37.800
You should be thankful.

00:25:37.930 --> 00:25:39.890
Of course, now our house

00:25:39.890 --> 00:25:42.180
is right by your
Grandfather's shrine...

00:25:42.180 --> 00:25:44.600
but l think that's
kind of convenient.

00:25:44.600 --> 00:25:47.560
Eat this, too.
It's good.

00:25:48.860 --> 00:25:53.280
You're lucky.
You don't have a scratch.

00:25:53.280 --> 00:25:55.860
You really ought to be
thanking me.

00:25:55.860 --> 00:25:59.120
After all, l protected you
at my own personal risk.

00:25:59.530 --> 00:26:03.450
But most of the crash
was absorbed by our ship.

00:26:03.450 --> 00:26:05.290
That's why you were O.K.

00:26:05.290 --> 00:26:07.750
So that's why our
landing point was off?

00:26:07.750 --> 00:26:10.290
l almost landed back
in that damn cave.

00:26:10.630 --> 00:26:13.380
l thought there was
another young lady with you.

00:26:13.380 --> 00:26:14.760
Where did she go?

00:26:15.630 --> 00:26:17.220
She's over there.

00:26:24.890 --> 00:26:27.310
Sasami, what are you doing?

00:26:27.310 --> 00:26:30.060
Come and help me
save Ryu-oh, my ship!

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:32.480
lt's too big for us to handle.

00:26:32.480 --> 00:26:34.030
We'll never get it out.

00:26:37.990 --> 00:26:42.280
l can't get stranded
on a remote planet like this.

00:26:42.450 --> 00:26:43.830
Oh. my ship,

00:26:43.830 --> 00:26:45.450
My Ryu-Oh!

00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:18.230
PREVIEW OF NEXT EPISODE

00:29:19.480 --> 00:29:21.730
l can't go home now!

00:29:22.190 --> 00:29:24.740
Ayeka heard about
Yosho's whereabouts,...

00:29:24.740 --> 00:29:26.200
and became sick.

00:29:26.200 --> 00:29:28.240
Ryoko is teasing Ayeka.

00:29:28.450 --> 00:29:30.740
What should l do?

00:29:31.120 --> 00:29:34.540
Tenchi, be nice to my sister.

00:29:34.540 --> 00:29:37.040
She's completely innocent.

00:29:37.750 --> 00:29:41.590
Episode #3
HELLO RYO-OHKI!

00:29:41.920 --> 00:29:43.340
Can Tenchi protect her
with his love?

00:29:43.340 --> 00:29:46.090
HELLO RYO-OHKI!
